{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03115","headline":"奉和圣制经河上公庙 · 张九龄","name":"奉和圣制经河上公庙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔者河边叟，谁知隐与仙。\n姓名终不识，章句此空传。\n迹爲坐忘晦，言犹强着诠。\n精灵竟何所，祠宇独依然。\n道在纡宸睠，风行动睿篇。\n从兹化天下，清净复何先。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03115.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03115","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}